# No barrels

Import every public symbol from **its own file**. Never a folder `index`. Each component is a folder: `{Name}/{Name}.tsx` (or `.astro`).

```ts
// yes
import { CartButton } from '@/features/cart-manage/views/components/CartButton/CartButton';

// no
import { CartButton } from '@/features/cart-manage';
import { CartButton } from '@/features/cart-manage/views/components';
```

Law:

- No `index.ts` / `index.tsx` re-export files anywhere under `src/`.
- No `export * from` / re-export barrels.
- Lint: `no-restricted-syntax` blocks `export * from` (`eslint.config.mjs`).
